      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 178090867737362805, guid: ff197ec3a370c874fb0e87aa37d5d0f3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: A beat-up locker that has been closed too many times by too many muscular
        arms.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 178090867737362805, guid: ff197ec3a370c874fb0e87aa37d5d0f3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Whoever owns it must be playing right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 178090867737362805, guid: ff197ec3a370c874fb0e87aa37d5d0f3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: The stuff in this locker is a lot like the stuff you have at home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 178090867737362805, guid: ff197ec3a370c874fb0e87aa37d5d0f3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: It's cool knowing how similar life is to people at different schools.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
